  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Broschure for Dakar (EFA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Broschyr inf&#xf6;r Dakar(EFA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ta fram en liten historik &#xf6;ver vad DESO/UND gjort de senaste 10 &#xe5;ren inom undervisningsomr&#xe5;det. Broschyren skulle distribueras under konferensen &quot;Education for All&quot; i Dakar i april 2000. Broschyren finns b&#xe5;de p&#xe5; svenska och engelska och delas ut i olika relevanta sammanhang. Broschyr best&#xe4;lles fr&#xe5;n sida.order&#xc9;special.lagerhus.se</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To produce a small historic review of what DESO/Ed. Division has done during the last 10 years within the field of education. The brochure was distributed during the conference &quot;Education for All&quot; in Dakar in April 2000. The brochure exists in Swedish and English language and is distributed in relevant occasions. It is available from stock.</narrative>
  </description>
